# Power BI Report Server Mini Project

## Business Problem

The goal of this project is to document an on-premises reporting workflow using Power BI Report Server concepts.

## Tools Used

- Power BI Desktop for Report Server
- Power BI Report Server
- Power BI report files
- Documentation

## Key Topics

- Power BI Service vs Power BI Report Server
- Power BI Desktop for Report Server
- Publish flow
- Folder structure
- Permissions
- Scheduled refresh concept

